   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Recommending with the subjunctive",
     "texto": [
      "To give general advice: **Recomenda-se que durma oito horas** (it is recommended that one sleeps eight hours). Other expressions: **É aconselhável que** (it is advisable that), **Convém que** (it is suitable that). All are followed by **que** + subjunctive."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Habits",
     "texto": [
      "To talk about diet and exercise: **é bom que faças exercício** (it's good that you exercise). With **não é bom que** (it's not good that) you warn about something: **não é bom que bebas álcool todos os dias**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
